<title>UK: Clinton leaves Britain after one-day visit.</title>
<headline>Clinton leaves Britain after one-day visit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton left Britain on Thursday after a one-day official visit during which he cemented his friendship with new Prime Minister Tony Blair.</p>
<p>His plane took off from London's Heathrow Airport just after 11 p.m. (2200 GMT).</p>
